ood,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc0d0ae47-f11a-4faa-93eb-6ccf692bcef2_560x984.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!qVuY!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc0d0ae47-f11a-4faa-93eb-6ccf692bcef2_560x984.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!qVuY!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc0d0ae47-f11a-4faa-93eb-6ccf692bcef2_560x984.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><div class=\"paywall-jump\" data-component-name=\"PaywallToDOM\"></div><p></p><h2><span>The trade</span></h2><p><span>The name is </span><strong><span>Constellium [CSTM]</span></strong><span>, a downstream aluminium converter. I bought it and allocated </span><strong><span>3.5% of the portfolio</span></strong><span> to the position.</span></p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><div class=\"image-link image2\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GS7j!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb5c2c0b9-3cf0-4196-a703-005099885e3e_912x40.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GS7j!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb5c2c0b9-3cf0-4196-a703-005099885e3e_912x40.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GS7j!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb5c2c0b9-3cf0-4196-a703-005099885e3e_912x40.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GS7j!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb5c2c0b9-3cf0-4196-a703-005099885e3e_912x40.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GS7j!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb5c2c0b9-3cf0-4196-a703-005099885e3e_912x40.png\" width=\"912\" height=\"40\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/b5c2c0b9-3cf0-4196-a703-005099885e3e_912x40.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:40,&quot;width&quot;:912,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:4774,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://www.beatingthetide.com/i/207193827?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb5c2c0b9-3cf0-4196-a703-005099885e3e_912x40.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GS7j!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb5c2c0b9-3cf0-4196-a703-005099885e3e_912x40.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GS7j!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb5c2c0b9-3cf0-4196-a703-005099885e3e_912x40.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GS7j!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb5c2c0b9-3cf0-4196-a703-005099885e3e_912x40.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GS7j!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb5c2c0b9-3cf0-4196-a703-005099885e3e_912x40.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div></div></div></div></figure></div><p><span>Constellium just printed the best quarter in its history: revenue up 24% y/y and EBITDA ex metal lag up 78% to an all-time record. Ten weeks after guiding 2026 EBITDA to $780M to $820M, management raised the range to $900M to $940M and lifted FCF guidance from above $200M to above $275M. The board approved a new $300M buyback running to 2028, about 7% of the market cap, on a business that now sits at 2.2x leverage with no debt due until 2028. The shares trade around 8.7x forward earnings and at half of what my DCF says the business is worth, a $60 target against a price near $30. The honest catch, which I size against in full inside the deep dive, is that a slice of the 2026 windfall is temporary. Even after I fade all of it, the number still clears today’s price.</span></p><p><span>The full deep dive, with the segment-by-segment walk, the complete DCF build, the steel-manned bear case and the RankedStocks read, comes out later this week, Monday at the latest.</span></p><p></p><p></p><p></p>",
